{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密和尚法衣塔、費和尚舍利塔、車和尚全身塔，三塔同一室。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱光旭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱耀祖，時士，金陵醫王。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱培繼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱三禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金粟繭紙箋藏，今僅存四十餘軸，或云宋賜，或云五聖書。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楚菴璨監院請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲澤旵侍者請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法名原濟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "門人太原楊耀祖捐俸，敬梓\n　金粟沙翁和尚語錄三卷，用資\n　　先太翁明樓公，先太恭人孟氏，伏願速悟\n　　圓通，華開見佛，頓超覺路，同燦心燈者。\n　　　版存浙江嘉興府楞嚴寺經坊流通。\n　　康熙十八年浴佛日吉旦"}
{"id": null, "n": "0309c0801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0309c0801", "type": "add", "text": "已【CB】，巳【嘉興】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0310a1901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0310a1901", "type": "add", "text": "眵【CB】，𭿂【嘉興】"}
